---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Aegis Gate • Ingress Zero-Trust & Identity Gateway | Aegis"
  description="Edge Zero-Trust gateway that filters inbound attacks, unifies authentication (SSO), and adapts to your infrastructure size."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Hero Section Module 1 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 pt-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>🛡️ AEGIS GATE • INGRESS ZERO-TRUST &amp; IDENTITY GATEWAY</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Secure 100% of your application access and shut down Zero-Day exploits.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        The first Edge security boundary that filters attacks, unifies identity (SSO), and scales to any infrastructure footprint — <strong>from 25 MB RAM on a local mini-server to multi-region Kubernetes clusters.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/get-started/" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-lg">
          🧪 Test API Security (Free)
        </a>
        <a href="#tech-specs" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-sm border border-slate-700">
          📚 Tech Specs &amp; Caddyfile
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Metaphor & Comparison Table -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-xl space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2 font-mono">💡 THE INTELLIGENT SECURITY AIRLOCK</h2>
        <blockquote class="text-slate-200 text-base italic border-l-4 border-cyan-500 pl-4 py-1">
          Imagine an office building: without Aegis Gate, every internal office has its own lock, often outdated or left unlocked (software vulnerabilities). <strong>Aegis Gate posts a guard at the building's main entrance</strong>. Without a valid badge, visitors cannot even enter the lobby. Your internal services remain completely invisible and unreachable to attackers.
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparative Table -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400">
              <th class="p-4">Attack / Infrastructure Risk</th>
              <th class="p-4">Without Aegis Gate (Legacy Architecture)</th>
              <th class="p-4">With Aegis Gate (Edge Zero-Trust)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Application Zero-Day Flaw (e.g. PaperCut CVE)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-400">Attacker or autonomous AI agent accesses software directly and gains server control.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">Attack neutralized at the edge: Unauthenticated requests rejected (HTTP 401) before reaching the application.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Weak &amp; Stolen Credentials</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Siloed, reused credentials vulnerable to credential stuffing.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-cyan-400">Centralized SSO &amp; MFA: Unified modern authentication (Passkeys / WebAuthn).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Server Resource Bloat</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Legacy IAM engines (Java/JVM) eating 1 GB RAM for just 5 users.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">Adaptive Frugality: From 25 MB RAM (Authelia Go) to a zero-overhead configuration.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Deep Dive Architecture Adaptative 3 Modes -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center">⚙️ Adaptive Dual-Engine Aegis Gate Architecture</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-2">MODE A: ON-PREM &amp; SMB</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Aegis Gate Light</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Reverse-proxy Caddy/Nginx + Go OIDC engine (<strong>Authelia</strong>). Ultra-frugal footprint of ~15 to 25 MB RAM (96% resource savings).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-2">MODE B: MANAGED SAAS</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Cloud Direct M365 / Google</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Direct OIDC/JWT integration with Microsoft Entra ID or Google Workspace. <strong>0 MB local IAM overhead</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-400 font-bold mb-2">MODE C: ENTERPRISE &amp; CRITICAL</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Aegis Gate Enterprise</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Envoy Proxy + Authorino PEP (gRPC) + <strong>Keycloak v26</strong> cluster + OpenFGA (ReBAC) for compliance-certified topologies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tech Specs Snippet -->
    <div id="tech-specs" class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="text-slate-400 mb-3">// docker-compose.aegis-gate-light.yml (Frugal SMB Packaging)</div>
      <pre is:raw class="text-cyan-300 overflow-x-auto">
version: '3.8'
services:
  aegis-edge-gateway:
    image: caddy:2-alpine
    ports: ["80:80", "443:443"]
    environment:
      - AUTH_PROVIDER_URL=http://aegis-authelia:9091
  aegis-authelia:
    image: authelia/authelia:latest
    deploy:
      resources:
        limits:
          memory: 35M # Ultra-frugal certified RAM footprint
      </pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <div class="text-center bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to secure your access with a frugal architecture?</h3>
      <a href="/get-started/" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm shadow-xl">
        🧪 Run a passive test on your domain
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
